voltorb/env/pinball_env.py is derived from NicoleFaye/pokemon-pinball-gym, MIT licensed.
https://github.com/NicoleFaye/pokemon-pinball-gym

What was kept: the PyBoy initialization and cartridge check, the ball-launch sequence, and
the episode-termination logic.

What was replaced: the observation layer (RAM-only float vector rather than pixels), the
reward layer (a survive -> score -> dex curriculum), the action space (4 held-state actions
rather than 5 press/release actions), and reset (savestate reload rather than game reset).

